Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 07:50:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 6th grade: Potion Lab stations 1 to 4 (unit 6, variables
 and expressions)

Ingredients (parts of expressions; evaluating with one variable, with
exponents, and with two variables, including fractions), Recipe Cards
(writing expressions from words and stories, then finding the value),
Mixing Bowl (GCF, LCM, and which one a word problem needs), and
Cauldron (factoring a sum with the GCF, the distributive property with
variables, and equivalent expressions). Evaluating reuses the Clock
Tower's order-of-operations engine, showing the substituted expression
with each step. Wrong expression choices are checked to never be
secretly equivalent. 13 Khan skills and 12 new mix-ups. Stations 5 and
6 (equations and inequalities) show as coming soon.

